:: Night event - dark building
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHT</h1>
<br /><br />
<center>
	<<image 'places/explore/night_building.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
<<set _nightBack = setup.night.backPassage()>>
Your light found a building nobody had bothered with in daylight: the front was a collapsed mess, but round the back a door hung open on one hinge. Inside, the dust on the floor was unbroken. Nobody had been in here for a long time.
<br /><br />
Shelves, cupboards, a stairwell going up into the dark. Searching it all would take a while, and a light moving from window to window could be seen from a long way off.
<br /><br />
<div id="nb_thorough">
	<<linkreplace 'Search the whole building'>>
		<<run $('#nb_quick').hide()>>
		<<addhours 1>>
		<<if setup.percentageChance(20)>>
			<<set _nbFound = setup.night.loot('building', 2)>>
			You went room by room. You had already filled your bag with <strong><<= _nbFound>></strong> when a floorboard creaked somewhere above you, and it was not your foot on it.
			<br /><br />
			<<say 'Squatter' setup.ImagePath+'/people/anonguy.png'>>
				That's my stuff you're carrying. Put it down and get out of my house.
			<</say>>
			<br />
			A man came down the stairs with a knife held low, squinting into your light.
			<br /><br />
			<<link 'Fight him'>>
				<<generateEnemies 1 0 1>>
				<<fight $enemies _nightBack _nightBack>>
			<</link>><<link 'Run with what you have'>>
				<<goto _nightBack>>
			<</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<set _nbFound = setup.night.loot('building', 3)>>
			You went room by room, into every cupboard and under every bed. It took the best part of an hour, but the building had never been picked over.
			<br /><br />
			You found <strong><<= _nbFound>></strong>.
			<br /><br />
			<<link 'Head back'>>
				<<goto _nightBack>>
			<</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="nb_quick">
	<<linkreplace 'Grab what is in reach and go'>>
		<<run $('#nb_thorough').hide()>>
		<<set _nbFound = setup.night.loot('building', 1)>>
		You swept the ground floor with your light, took what was in easy reach and left before anyone could wonder about the glow in the windows.
		<br /><br />
		You found <strong><<= _nbFound>></strong>.
		<br /><br />
		<<link 'Head back'>>
			<<goto _nightBack>>
		<</link>>
	<</linkreplace>>
</div>
